# Example Ditto nginx basic-auth file.
#
# DO NOT commit the real nginx.htpasswd — it is gitignored.
# Generate it locally with services/ditto/nginx/generate-htpasswd.sh
# (or `htpasswd -nbB user password >> nginx.htpasswd`).
#
# Expected users:
#   ditto    — main API user (DITTO_USER / DITTO_PASS in .env)
#   devops   — Ditto DevOps API (DITTO_DEVOPS_USER / DITTO_DEVOPS_PASSWORD in .env)
